  "body": "Surface.deinit joins the search, renderer and IO threads from the app thread, which is the only thread that drains the app mailbox. A thread blocked pushing into a full mailbox never wakes, so the join never returns and the app thread is gone for good.\r\n\r\nFixes #14245\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: Claude Code was used to develop this PR but I have thoroughly reviewed the code.",
